<heading>show - Show one stored run.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  show TOPIC RUN
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Shows the entries of one stored run, grouped by letter. TOPIC
may be an id or a topic name; RUN is the run id as shown by
'run list'. Runs are immutable snapshots.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
show "Roman Empire" 1
  Show run #1 of the topic.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
new, list
</paragraph>
